<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Optus to spend A$25 mln on satellite venture.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Optus to spend A$25 mln on satellite venture.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pay television operator Optus Vision said on Monday it is to invest A$25 million in the satellite pay TV infrastructure joint venture with Australis Media Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
